so he says therefore uh french and now this this instruction of the blessed one is to be constantly given attention there is way there is wavering in one who is dependent there is no wavering in one who is independent when there is no wavering there is no tranquility there is tranquility when there is tranquility there's no bias no bias there's no coming and going

65
00:06:40,036 --> 00:06:43,843
When there's no coming and going, there's no passing away and reappearing.

66
00:06:44,363 --> 00:06:50,535
