72
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:25,182
There's no of that wrong desire left in them.

73
00:07:27,285 --> 00:07:30,668
Now, when, of course, there's no wavering, there's absolute tranquility.

74
00:07:30,708 --> 00:07:33,009
There's no restlessness in the system.

75
00:07:33,884 --> 00:07:41,514
And when there's tranquility, that also means that there's no view or opinion of I'm right and everybody else is wrong.

76
00:07:41,615 --> 00:07:43,637
There's no ego there.

77
00:07:43,697 --> 00:07:45,281
There's no sense of pride.

78
00:07:46,903 --> 00:07:51,350
Now, when there's no sense of pride and there's no self, then, of course, there's no coming and going.

79
00:07:51,569 --> 00:07:53,713
